L=[
("chemicals","med","Why should laundry chemicals never be mixed by hand, like bleach with ammonia?","¿Por qué nunca se deben mezclar a mano químicos de lavandería, como cloro con amoniaco?",["They can release toxic gas","They stop cleaning","They turn the water blue","They make the machine louder"],["Pueden soltar un gas tóxico","Dejan de limpiar","Pintan el agua de azul","Hacen más ruido en la máquina"],"Bleach plus ammonia or acids makes dangerous gases. Use only the dispensing system.","El cloro con amoniaco o ácidos produce gases peligrosos. Usa solo el sistema dosificador.",HAZ),
("dryer","easy","What should you clean before every dryer load or at least every shift?","¿Qué debes limpiar antes de cada carga de secadora o al menos cada turno?",["The lint screen","The outside paint","The floor drain","The control label"],["El filtro de pelusa","La pintura de afuera","La coladera del piso","La etiqueta de controles"],"Lint buildup is a leading cause of dryer fires.","La pelusa acumulada es una de las principales causas de incendios en secadoras.",DRY),
("dryer","hard","Why shouldn't you leave hot, just-dried towels piled in a cart overnight?","¿Por qué no se deben dejar toallas recién secadas y calientes amontonadas en un carrito toda la noche?",["Oily residue in hot linens can self-heat and catch fire","They get too soft","They change color","Guests prefer cold towels"],["Los residuos de aceite en ropa caliente pueden calentarse solos y prenderse","Se ponen demasiado suaves","Cambian de color","Los huéspedes prefieren toallas frías"],"Let the cool-down cycle finish and spread hot linens out — spontaneous combustion is real in laundries.","Deja que termine el ciclo de enfriado y extiende la ropa caliente; en lavanderías la combustión espontánea sí pasa.",DRY),
("stains","med","A white towel has makeup stains. What's the right move?","Una toalla blanca tiene manchas de maquillaje. ¿Qué es lo correcto?",["Pre-treat it per the stain process, then rewash","Fold it and send it up","Throw it away immediately","Bleach it in the sink"],["Pretratarla según el proceso de manchas y volver a lavar","Doblarla y mandarla a los cuartos","Tirarla de inmediato","Echarle cloro en el lavabo"],"Stained linen sent to rooms is a top guest complaint. Pre-treat and rewash; retire it if it won't come out.","La ropa manchada en los cuartos es de las quejas más comunes. Pretrata y relava; si no sale, dala de baja.",BP),
("stains","easy","A sheet still has a stain after rewash. What do you do with it?","Una sábana sigue manchada después de relavarla. ¿Qué haces con ella?",["Pull it as a rag or reject per policy","Put it on a bed with the stain at the bottom","Iron over it","Send it up anyway"],["Retirarla como trapo o desecho según la política","Ponerla en la cama con la mancha abajo","Plancharla encima","Mandarla de todos modos"],"Track rejects so the hotel can order replacements.","Lleva registro de lo que se da de baja para que el hotel pida reemplazos.",BP),
("sorting","easy","Why sort linens before washing?","¿Por qué se separa la ropa antes de lavarla?",["Different items and soil levels need different wash formulas","To count them faster only","Because machines only take one color","It doesn't matter"],["Cada tipo de prenda y nivel de suciedad necesita una fórmula distinta","Solo para contar más rápido","Porque las máquinas solo aceptan un color","No importa"],"Sheets, towels, and heavily soiled rags each wash better on their own cycle.","Sábanas, toallas y trapos muy sucios se lavan mejor cada uno en su ciclo.",BP),
("blood","med","A bag of linen is marked as having blood on it. How should you handle it?","Una bolsa de ropa viene marcada con sangre. ¿Cómo la manejas?",["Wear gloves and follow the soiled-linen procedure; don't shake it out","Shake it to check","Sort it bare-handed","Leave it on the floor"],["Usar guantes y seguir el procedimiento de ropa contaminada; no sacudirla","Sacudirla para revisar","Separarla sin guantes","Dejarla en el piso"],"Shaking contaminated linen can spread fluids. Gloves on, minimal handling.","Sacudir ropa contaminada puede esparcir fluidos. Guantes puestos y manipularla lo menos posible.",BBP),
("sharps","med","You feel something sharp while sorting a linen bag. What do you do?","Sientes algo punzante al separar una bolsa de ropa. ¿Qué haces?",["Stop, don't reach in, and get your supervisor","Dig around to find it","Dump it on the table","Ignore it"],["Detenerte, no meter la mano y llamar a tu supervisora","Buscar con la mano","Vaciarla en la mesa","Ignorarlo"],"Needles and glass hide in linens. Never reach blindly into bags.","Agujas y vidrios se esconden en la ropa. Nunca metas la mano a ciegas.",BBP),
("machine","med","The washer door won't open and the drum is still moving. What do you do?","La puerta de la lavadora no abre y el tambor sigue girando. ¿Qué haces?",["Wait for it to stop completely — never force the door","Pry it open","Unplug and yank it","Hit the door"],["Esperar a que pare por completo; nunca forzar la puerta","Abrirla con palanca","Desconectarla y jalar","Golpear la puerta"],"Door locks protect you from a spinning drum. Report a stuck lock to maintenance.","El seguro de la puerta te protege del tambor girando. Reporta a mantenimiento si se atora.",BP),
("machine","med","A washer is leaking water onto the floor. First steps?","Una lavadora tira agua al piso. ¿Qué haces primero?",["Stop the machine, put up a wet-floor sign, and call maintenance","Keep running loads","Mop around it and leave","Stand in the water to fix it"],["Detener la máquina, poner letrero de piso mojado y llamar a mantenimiento","Seguir lavando","Trapear alrededor y irte","Pararte en el agua para arreglarla"],"Water plus electric machines is dangerous. Stop it and keep people from slipping.","El agua y las máquinas eléctricas son peligrosas. Detén la máquina y evita resbalones.",SLIP),
("chemicals","med","Where do you find what to do if detergent gets on your skin?","¿Dónde encuentras qué hacer si el detergente te cae en la piel?",["The product's Safety Data Sheet (SDS)","The washer manual","The schedule board","The guest directory"],["La hoja de datos de seguridad (SDS) del producto","El manual de la lavadora","El tablero de horarios","El directorio del huésped"],"SDS sheets list first aid and required PPE. Know where the binder is.","Las SDS dicen los primeros auxilios y el equipo de protección. Sabe dónde está la carpeta.",HAZ),
("ppe","easy","What protective gear do you wear when changing chemical drums?","¿Qué equipo de protección usas al cambiar tambos de químicos?",["Gloves and eye protection per the SDS","Just your uniform","Sunglasses only","Nothing if you're quick"],["Guantes y lentes de protección según la SDS","Solo tu uniforme","Solo lentes de sol","Nada si lo haces rápido"],"Concentrated laundry chemicals can burn skin and eyes.","Los químicos de lavandería concentrados pueden quemar piel y ojos.",HAZ),
("folding","easy","Why fold towels to the hotel's standard every time?","¿Por qué doblar las toallas siempre según el estándar del hotel?",["Rooms look consistent and stacks fit carts and shelves","It's faster to skip it","Guests never notice","So they dry"],["Los cuartos se ven iguales y las pilas caben en carritos y anaqueles","Es más rápido no hacerlo","Los huéspedes nunca lo notan","Para que se sequen"],"Consistent folds make rooms look cared for and speed up attendants.","Los dobleces iguales hacen que los cuartos se vean cuidados y agilizan a las recamaristas.",BP),
("par","med","Linen is running low at 10 a.m. on a full house. What should you tell your supervisor?","Falta ropa a las 10 a.m. con el hotel lleno. ¿Qué le avisas a tu supervisora?",["What's short and how long until the next loads are ready","Nothing, they'll find out","That attendants should reuse sheets","To close rooms"],["Qué falta y en cuánto tiempo salen las siguientes cargas","Nada, ya se darán cuenta","Que las recamaristas reusen sábanas","Que cierren cuartos"],"Early heads-up lets the supervisor reorder rooms so no one waits.","Avisar temprano deja que la supervisora reorganice cuartos para que nadie espere.",BP),
("ergonomics","med","How should you unload heavy wet sheets from a washer?","¿Cómo debes sacar sábanas mojadas y pesadas de la lavadora?",["Pull smaller bundles into a cart at waist height","Yank the whole load at once","Lean in and twist","Use your foot"],["Sacar bultos pequeños a un carrito a la altura de la cintura","Jalar toda la carga de un golpe","Meterte y girar","Usar el pie"],"Wet linen is heavy. Smaller pulls without twisting protect your back.","La ropa mojada pesa. Sacarla de a poco y sin girar protege tu espalda.",LIFT),
("heat","med","The laundry room is very hot in July. What helps you stay safe?","La lavandería está muy caliente en julio. ¿Qué te ayuda a estar segura?",["Drink water often, take cool breaks, and tell your supervisor if you feel dizzy","Skip water to avoid bathroom breaks","Work faster to finish","Wear extra layers"],["Tomar agua seguido, descansar en un lugar fresco y avisar si te mareas","No tomar agua para no ir al baño","Trabajar más rápido para acabar","Ponerte más ropa"],"Heat illness can come on fast near dryers. Water, rest and shade.","El golpe de calor puede llegar rápido cerca de las secadoras. Agua, descanso y sombra.",HEAT,("06-01","09-15")),
("lostfound","easy","You find a phone in a pillowcase. What do you do?","Encuentras un celular dentro de una funda. ¿Qué haces?",["Turn it in to lost and found with where and when it was found","Keep it in your locker","Put it on the dryer","Give it to the next guest"],["Entregarlo a objetos perdidos con dónde y cuándo se encontró","Guardarlo en tu locker","Ponerlo sobre la secadora","Dárselo al siguiente huésped"],"Check pockets and pillowcases — and log every item found.","Revisa bolsillos y fundas, y registra todo lo que encuentres.",BP),
("machine","hard","Why not overload a washer?","¿Por qué no se debe sobrecargar una lavadora?",["Linens don't get clean and the machine wears out faster","It saves water","It's what the manual says to do","It makes towels fluffier"],["La ropa no queda limpia y la máquina se desgasta más rápido","Ahorra agua","Así lo dice el manual","Deja las toallas más esponjosas"],"Clothes need room to move. Follow the machine's weight rating.","La ropa necesita espacio para moverse. Respeta la capacidad de la máquina.",BP),
("cleaning","med","Where should clean linen never be placed?","¿Dónde nunca se debe poner la ropa limpia?",["On the floor or in carts used for dirty linen","On a clean shelf","In a covered cart","On a folding table"],["En el piso o en carritos de ropa sucia","En un anaquel limpio","En un carrito tapado","En una mesa de doblar"],"Keep clean and dirty separate so clean linen stays clean.","Mantén lo limpio separado de lo sucio para que la ropa limpia siga limpia.",BP),
("bedbugs","hard","Linen from a suspected bed bug room arrives sealed in a bag. How is it handled?","Llega ropa sellada en bolsa de un cuarto con posibles chinches. ¿Cómo se maneja?",["Keep it sealed until it goes straight into a hot wash and hot dryer","Open it on the sorting table","Mix it with other linen","Leave it in the hall"],["Mantenerla sellada hasta meterla directo a lavado y secado caliente","Abrirla en la mesa de separar","Mezclarla con otra ropa","Dejarla en el pasillo"],"High heat kills bed bugs; opening the bag lets them escape.","El calor alto mata las chinches; abrir la bolsa las deja escapar.",BED),
]
for t in L: n(LA,*t)
